      "statement": "pnpm test runs the root's own node --test scripts/**/*.test.ts suite first (scripts are deliberately off the build hot path and type-checked separately in CI), then vp run --filter '!cloudflare-os' --cache test — the filter hardcodes the root package name because -r would select the root and run its suite twice.",
