      "id": "claim_2e3399afbf0f46b6a5c80edda5cf05e7",
      "statement": "Each vitest package's test entry is a Vite+ task rather than a package.json script because vp forbids a task and a script sharing a name; run one package's tests via pnpm --filter <package> test:run (straight to vitest) or vp run -F <package> test (through the cache).",
