      "statement": "Some packages run two vitest passes: workshop-backend builds its generated inputs (browser runtime, format blueprints) then runs vitest plus a second integration-config pass, gatekeeper-cloudflare adds a workerd config for RpcTarget/RpcStub/DO tests, gatekeeper-context adds a Node config, and gatekeeper-scheduler adds an app config.",
